{
	"SchemaName": "WellHealth_ClaimLevel",
	"HeaderRow": 1,
	"//": [
		"Well Health 'Claim Level' sheet. Mapping per AveragesTable_AllAccounts_Field Mapping_V1.19.xlsx,",
		"ClaimLevelFactTable, column 'Well Health'.",
		"Each column is a source header; where it is not already a COMMON alias, Aliases names the COMMON",
		"column it feeds - a lab-only alias group, so ClaimLevel.schema.json is unchanged for other labs.",
		"'Deposit Date' is declared on its own so it is the ONLY source of CheckDate.",
		"'Payment Entered' is the posting date (Analyze Pathology's 'Posted Date'): it feeds the COMMON",
		"'Payment Posted Date' column, loaded as PostingDate / PaymentPostedDate.",
		"'Denial Deposit Date' has no COMMON target at claim level; it is appended under its own name and",
		"loaded as DenialDate. The 'Denial Date' alias only matters at line level, where it is COMMON.",
		"'Facility Name' feeds ClinicName; Facility comes from 'Office Name' (V1.19), so no KeepRaw here.",
		"'Charge Last Bill Date' deliberately has NO 'Last Billed Date' alias: the COMMON FirstBilledDate",
		"aliases include 'Last billed date', so that alias made FirstBilledDate read the LAST bill date.",
		"It reaches 'Last Billed Date' through the COMMON alias instead.",
		"The source spells the posted-week header with two spaces ('Payment Entered  Week'). It is declared",
		"as 'Posted Week' so the CSV column has a stable name whichever spelling the file carries."
	],
	"Columns": [
